{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"诗篇","commonName":"诗篇","title":"诗篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"dbc381a0d937a76da00e224516c540ebdb97b246a5380bed1b67f15a492e5440","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":40,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["颂赞之歌"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大卫的诗，交与伶长。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我曾耐性等候耶和华；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他垂听我的呼求。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他从祸坑里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从淤泥中，把我拉上来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我的脚立在磐石上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我脚步稳当。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他使我口唱新歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是赞美我们 神的话。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"许多人必看见而惧怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并要倚靠耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"那倚靠耶和华、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不理会狂傲和偏向虚假之辈的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这人便为有福！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华—我的 神啊，你所行的奇事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并你向我们所怀的意念甚多，不能向你陈明；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若要陈明，其事不可胜数。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"祭物和礼物，你不喜悦；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你已经开通我的耳朵。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燔祭和赎罪祭非你所要。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时我说：看哪，我来了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的事在经卷上已经记载了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的 神啊，我乐意照你的旨意行；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的律法在我心里。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"我在大会中宣传公义的佳音；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不止住我的嘴唇。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，这是你所知道的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我未曾把你的公义藏在心里；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已陈明你的信实和你的救恩；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在大会中未曾隐瞒你的慈爱和诚实。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，求你不要向我止住你的慈悲！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿你的慈爱和诚实常常保佑我！","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["求助的祷告"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"因有无数的祸患围困我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的罪孽追上了我，使我不能昂首；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这罪孽比我的头发还多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就心寒胆战。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，求你开恩搭救我！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，求你速速帮助我！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿那些寻找我、要灭我命的，一同抱愧蒙羞！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿那些喜悦我受害的，退后受辱！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿那些对我说阿哈、阿哈的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因羞愧而败亡！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"愿一切寻求你的，因你高兴欢喜！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿那些喜爱你救恩的，常说：当尊耶和华为大！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我是困苦穷乏的，主仍顾念我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是帮助我的，搭救我的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"神啊，求你不要耽延！","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/40.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/41.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/39.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}